[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot NNN - Don't target the Bonecrusher
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 2 life. You control Bonecrusher Giant (4/3; whenever it becomes the target of a spell, it deals 2 damage to that spell's controller) and two untapped Mountains, and have Brute Force and Fling in hand. The opponent is at 7 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-becomes-target-trigger-self | Bonecrusher Giant's trigger resolves before the spell that targeted it (CR 603.3, 405.5), even your own: Brute Force on the Giant kills you at 2 life before the pump resolves; Fling only targets the opponent, so attack for 4 and then Fling the Giant for 4
